OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after tiger attack at
OL,4,Awildlife park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being attacked by
OL,7,Fa tiger at Yorkshire Wildlife Park,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it had been
OL,11,Fcalled at 13:35 BST to reports of a man
OL,12,Fentering the tiger enclosure at the
OL,13,Fattraction near Doncaster.
OL,15,FThe tiger subsequently attacked the man
OL,16,Fand he died at the scene, the force
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FHis family had been informed and were
OL,20,Fbeing supported by officers, it added.
